# Canvas App Functions


- Report Issue Button

```text
Set(varSelectedAsset, ThisItem); 
Navigate(TicketScreen, ScreenTransition.Fade)
```

- Submit Button

```text
Patch(
    'IT Tickets',
    Defaults('IT Tickets'),
    {
        'Ticket Title': txtTitle.Text,
        Description: txtDesc.Text,
        'Requester Email': User().Email,
        'Related Asset': varSelectedAsset,
        'Ticket Status': 'Ticket Status (IT Tickets)'.Open,
        Priority: Switch(
            ddPriority.Selected.Value,
            "Low", 'Priority (IT Tickets)'.Low,
            "Medium", 'Priority (IT Tickets)'.Medium,
            "High", 'Priority (IT Tickets)'.High,
            'Priority (IT Tickets)'.Critical
        )
    }
);
Notify("IT Ticket logged successfully!", NotificationType.Success);
Navigate(HomeScreen)
```
